OL,3,GNEWSABreast screening patient was asked
OL,4,Afor images of themself in scam email
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS Western Isles says a patient was
OL,7,Fsent a fraudulent email asking them to
OL,8,Fsend photographs and videos of themself
OL,9,Ffollowing a breast screening
OL,10,Fappointment.
OL,12,FThe health board said the sender
OL,13,Fclaimed to be a health professional and
OL,14,Fwas requesting the images for
OL,15,Fassessment.
OL,17,FNHS Western Isles said it took patient
OL,18,Fconfidentiality and information
OL,19,Fsecurity "extremely seriously".
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,428,420,260,160,0,100
